# The corpus text IS committed. It cannot be regenerated: Wikipedia only
# serves the plaintext extract for an article's current revision, so an old
# revision is unrecoverable in this format (see rag/corpus/wikipedia.py).
# At ~324K it is small enough to version, and committing it is the only way
# a result stays reproducible.

# Embedding index: regenerable from the corpus.
data/index/

